    "summary": "Adds one lazy owner to actual VS Code activation/disposal, with private control, root-data and unclaimed Saved lanes, 30-second heartbeat and conservative 90-second confirmed lease, same-epoch resume/redelegation, epoch/expiry invalidation hooks and bounded best-effort end. Four real-socket tests use actual daemon session authority; broader unchanged activation-file cancellation is preserved separately, not counted as pass.",
